RuckCoin
A digital peer to peer network for the facilitation of asset transfer.

RuckCoin is a Ravencoin code fork: a new blockchain, not a Ravencoin snapshot. It is mineable (KAWPOW), issues no premine, and keeps Ravencoin's asset layer so anyone can create tokens on the RuckCoin network.

The project is aimed at veterans and community governance. Utility comes from the same primitives Ravencoin proved out — transferable assets, messaging, and restricted assets — on an independent chain.

Thank you to the Bitcoin and Ravencoin developers. RuckCoin is built on that work.
